To create new repo:
--> First create it on the website
Then go to the terminal and  in your repository you want to commit

1. Create a .gitignore
Ex. https://gist.github.com/octocat/9257657
BE SURE TO ADD *.png and *.root files to it as well!

2. git init
3. git add README.md 
4. git commit -m "first commit"
5. git branch -M main
6. git remote add origin git@github.com:mehmoo24/ComputeFluxConstraint.git
7. git push -u origin main

If the website repo already has for ex. a README file then do:
8. git pull --rebase origin main

